     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The difficulty occurs because x1,x2,x3 are observed without error, right?<div><br></div><div>As a simple hack one can use</div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x1 </span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> z </span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\">+</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lx1 + e1<br>x2 </span><font color=\"#666600\" style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">=<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> z </span>+<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lx2</span></font>\r\n\r\n + e2  <font color=\"#666600\" style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>x3 </span>=<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> z </span>+<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lx3</span></font>   + e3</div><div><br></div><div>where ei ~ Normal(0,s), where &quot;s&quot; is a small quantity. Then the model has a straight forward implementation along the lines you have tried.</div><div><br></div><div>This does only approximately give the model you want. I am not aware of SEM implementations in TMB,</div><div>so I do not have other solutions to point to.</div><div><br></div><div>Hans</div><div><br></div><div><br><div><br></div></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thu, Jan 2, 2020 at 3:18 AM &#39;Joshua Pritsker&#39; via TMB Users &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tmb-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Edit:<div><br></div><div>First codeblock should be </div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x1 </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> z </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">+</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lx1<br>x2 </span></span><font color=\"#666600\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> z </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lx2<br>x3 </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> z </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lx3</span></span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br><br>lx1 </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">~</span></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Normal</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> s_lx1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lx2 </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">~</span></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Normal</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">*</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lx1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> s_lx2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lx3 </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">~</span></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Normal</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">a</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">*</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lx2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> s_lx3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span></span></font><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">/* z ~ Normal(0, 1) */</span></span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>z is also latent<br><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked re